<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1839368236"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:12.000"><div begin="7.206" end="19.996" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="7.206" end="10.315" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="7.206" end="7.681">睁</span><span begin="7.681" end="8.027">开</span><span begin="8.027" end="8.344">眼</span> <span begin="8.344" end="8.878">怎</span><span begin="8.878" end="9.305">么又是</span><span begin="9.305" end="9.735">十</span><span begin="9.735" end="9.903">二</span><span begin="9.903" end="10.315">点</span></p><p begin="10.447" end="13.501" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="10.447" end="11.287">打开手机</span> <span begin="11.287" end="12.527">原来昨晚聊了</span><span begin="12.527" end="13.071">一整</span><span begin="13.071" end="13.501">夜</span></p><p begin="13.638" end="16.666" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="13.638" end="16.007">看着那句未读的晚安泡着</span><span begin="16.007" end="16.415">咖</span><span begin="16.415" end="16.666">啡</span></p><p begin="16.897" end="19.996" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="16.897" end="17.345">天啊</span> <span begin="17.345" end="17.596">到</span><span begin="17.596" end="17.956">底</span><span begin="17.956" end="18.366">为</span><span begin="18.366" end="19.332">什么还没有</span><span begin="19.332" end="19.996">回</span></p></div><div begin="20.053" end="34.212" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="20.053" end="23.028" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="20.053" end="20.602">差</span><span begin="20.602" end="20.749">一</span><span begin="20.749" end="21.149">点</span> <span begin="21.149" end="21.569">好</span><span begin="21.569" end="22.172">像就近</span><span begin="22.172" end="22.697">在眼</span><span begin="22.697" end="23.028">前</span></p><p begin="23.260" end="26.297" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="23.260" end="25.380">怎么怎么就是不想跨过</span><span begin="25.380" end="25.585">那</span><span begin="25.585" end="25.884">条</span><span begin="25.884" end="26.297">线</span></p><p begin="26.454" end="29.448" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="26.454" end="28.500">每晚梦里都不知道排练</span><span begin="28.500" end="28.802">过</span><span begin="28.802" end="29.148">几</span><span begin="29.148" end="29.448">遍</span></p><p begin="29.598" end="34.212" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="29.598" end="30.329">担心这</span><span begin="30.329" end="30.809">些</span> <span begin="30.809" end="31.201">都</span><span begin="31.201" end="31.723">是自我</span><span begin="31.723" end="32.136">催</span><span begin="32.136" end="34.212">眠</span></p></div><div begin="35.123" end="47.964" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="35.123" end="38.080" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="35.123" end="35.726">能不能</span><span begin="35.726" end="36.086">不</span><span begin="36.086" end="37.136">要在一</span><span begin="37.136" end="38.080">起</span></p><p begin="38.333" end="41.297" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="38.333" end="38.837">让我</span><span begin="38.837" end="39.269">继</span><span begin="39.269" end="39.424">续</span><span begin="39.424" end="40.333">想着</span><span begin="40.333" end="41.297">你</span></p><p begin="41.619" end="44.141" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="41.619" end="42.102">维持</span><span begin="42.102" end="42.528">这</span><span begin="42.528" end="42.760">样</span><span begin="42.760" end="43.459">的关</span><span begin="43.459" end="44.141">系</span></p><p begin="44.316" end="47.964" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="voice"><span begin="44.316" end="44.993">就算只</span><span begin="44.993" end="45.303">能</span><span begin="45.303" end="45.545">待</span><span begin="45.545" end="45.902">在</span><span begin="45.913" end="46.198">家</span><span begin="46.198" end="46.669">里</span> <span begin="46.955" end="47.166">我</span><span begin="47.166" end="47.531">也</span><span begin="47.531" end="47.631">愿</span><span begin="47.631" end="47.964">意</span></p></div><div begin="47.974" end="1:04.764" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin